  "meaning": "Assembly (a weakening, not a substantive derivation): the witness of NecessaryClassicalGodRootAt satisfies sigma.IsGod, so GodExists sigma.IsGod holds for the same signature and the same GOD_4 predicate. It puts the stage-two act-of-being and attribute composition (NecessaryClassicalGodRootFromUnderived and the other arguments concluding STMT-NECESSARY-CLASSICAL-GOD-ROOT) on a route to the working root STMT-GOD-EXISTS (owner direction 2026-11-09). As an assembly it closes the root only if its premise is closed (invariant 16 fixpoint); every upstream premise keeps its status. Necessity, uniqueness and the attributes are discarded; the converse fails.",
